*   **Audit**: Confirmed `users` table has `onboarding_completed` (via [20260208_add_onboarding_fields.sql](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/supabase/migrations/20260208_add_onboarding_fields.sql)).
*   **Gap Fix**: Update [src/types/User.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/types/User.ts) to include:
    ```typescript
    onboarding_completed?: boolean;
    onboarding_completed_at?: string;
    ```

### B. Store Update ([src/store/useStore.ts](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/store/useStore.ts))
*   Add `justFinishedOnboarding` boolean flag (persisted). 
