### E. Home Screen Views (`src/screens/self/*.tsx`)
*   Implement [WelcomeModal](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/components/self/WelcomeModal.tsx#25-72) integration in:
    *   [StudentSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/StudentSelfView.tsx) (Completed)
    *   [TeacherSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/TeacherSelfView.tsx)
    *   [PrincipalSelfView.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Naween/projects/polymath-platform/apps/gurudevi-mobile/src/screens/self/PrincipalSelfView.tsx)
*   Logic for all:
    *   Check `useStore.justFinishedOnboarding` on mount.
    *   If true -> Show Modal.
    *   On Dismiss -> Set store flag false.

## 3. Triple-Helix: Environment (The Specs)
*   **Database**: `public.users` table updates are already verified via SQL migration.
*   **Device**: Haptics must trigger on Skip/Complete.

## Verification Plan

